\* Unicode 17 data for String.prototype.normalize, toLowerCase, and toUpperCase, which engine262
\* takes from its host. Generated by a one-off script from the host's normalize, case mapping, and
\* Unicode properties, with the combining classes and primary composites of the UCD. Each table is
\* sorted by its first field. A run <<first, last, step, delta>> maps first, first + step, ...
\* last to code point + delta.

